{"entinygram":{"description":"entinyGram is our independent fork of Inugram and the official Telegram Android codebase.\n\nWhile Inugram established a clean, modular patchset architecture focused on minimalism, Material 3, and bugfixes, entinyGram pushes it further: restoring user privacy (Ghost Mode, anti-deletion), unlocking server-restricted capabilities, providing free AI translation & transcription, and introducing deep visual customization.","screenshots":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/IMG_20261005_124220.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124327.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124342.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124405.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124502.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124519.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_20261005_124530.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124541.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124610.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124624.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124636.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azt36/Orion-Store-assets-repo/refs/heads/main/EntinyGram/Screenshot_2026_1005_124705.jpg"]}}